      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それが、なんらかの「天変地異」で\r\nクリスタルが発生した……。",
        "official_en": "But at some point in time, <text style=\"italic\">something</>—maybe some kind of cataclysmic event—happened and brought about the crystals.",
        "real_en": null
      },
